# CASM post-Phase-12 hardening (WP77) trusted reference: casmchain1
#
# Independently hand-assembled from the casmchain1 fixture source in
# cmake/GenerateCasmTestFixtures.cmake. NOT produced by CASM. Proves the
# WP77 fix: a named constant whose right-hand side is another identifier
# (constant-to-constant chaining), with no arithmetic operator, must parse
# and terminate its own statement correctly instead of desyncing onto the
# following line.
#
# Source (.ORG $C000):
